    {
      "id": "2122924273945682305",
      "text": "GOAL: William Karlsson (5), Golden Knights. Assists: Trevor Connelly (7). Golden Knights 2, Stars 0, 9:33 left in the 3rd. #VegasBorn https://t.co/R4oj4vhEY5",
