      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122924060544000365",
      "text": "And Karlsson’s second goal is now even more important. Nils Lundkvist cuts into the offensive zone and beats Hill clean. 2-1 Vegas with nine minutes to go.",
      "url": "https://x.com/DerekHegna/status/2122924060544000365",
      "published": "2026-11-18T05:25:12+00:00",
      "likes": 1,
      "author": "Derek Hegna",
