      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122923829895077979",
      "text": "Power play doesn’t work, but the second unit delivers all the same. Trevor Connelly intercepts a puck in the slot and passes it off to William Karlsson, who catches Oettinger out of position. 2-0 Golden Knights, and 71’s on hat trick watch.",
      "url": "https://x.com/DerekHegna/status/2122923829895077979",
      "published": "2026-11-18T05:24:17+00:00",
      "likes": 1,
      "author": "Derek Hegna",
