      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122923637804318788",
      "text": "William Karlsson again. But the play from Connelly is unreal. Knocks down a clearing attempt. Freezes Oettinger, then slides it to Karlsson with an empty net. 2-0 #VGK",
      "url": "https://x.com/RyanHockeyGuy/status/2122923637804318788",
      "published": "2026-11-18T05:23:31+00:00",
      "likes": 16,
      "author": "Ryan The Hockey Guy",
