      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122923588890284330",
      "text": "Another turnover right in front of the net. This time it's Dallas, and Trevor Connelly makes them pay with a spectacular play. He faked the shot to get Oettinger to bite, then fed Karlsson for a one-timer. 2-0 Vegas",
      "url": "https://x.com/JesseGranger_/status/2122923588890284330",
      "published": "2026-11-18T05:23:20+00:00",
      "likes": 11,
      "author": "Jesse Granger",
      "handle": "JesseGranger_",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1836919164134711296/Xz3X5dDI_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122923528781701402",
      "text": "Take a bow, Trevor Connelly. Picks it off, makes a move, and drops it to William Karlsson for his second of the night. 2-0 #VGK",
      "url": "https://x.com/DannyWebster21/status/2122923528781701402",
      "published": "2026-11-18T05:23:05+00:00",
      "likes": 17,
      "author": "Danny Webster",
      "handle": "DannyWebster21",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2100985644051021824/g1hFwtS6_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122922338811515014",
      "text": "The Golden Knights are getting a power play here in the third period. Hintz for high sticking Eichel. Again, I would start the second unit. Let's see what #VGK will do.",
      "url": "https://x.com/RyanHockeyGuy/status/2122922338811515014",
      "published": "2026-11-18T05:18:22+00:00",
      "likes": 8,
      "author": "Ryan The Hockey Guy",
