    },
    {
      "id": "2122921659313393913",
      "text": "This game felt like it was half asleep, then Jeremy Lauzon made an unforced turnover right in front of his own net, and Adin Hill made a massive save to keep it 1-0. Hill hasn't been busy tonight, but he's been locked in when needed.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JesseGranger_/status/2122921659313393913",
      "published": "2026-11-18T05:15:40+00:00",
      "likes": 22,
      "author": "Jesse Granger",
