      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2122921633388396891",
      "text": "Jeremy Lauzon with an egregious turnover to Sam Steel. Adin Hill makes a spectacular save.",
      "url": "https://x.com/h_kirk6/status/2122921633388396891",
